  "historyNote": "#12839, eff 7-27-19; ss by #14341 EMERGENCY, eff 8-21-25 (formerly Lot 7209.01); ss by #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36 (formerly Lot 7212.01)",
